a4469d","text":"Calvin: Hi Dave! Nice to hear from you. Since last chat, some things have happened. I had a lil car accident last Friday, kinda upsetting but no one was hurt. I've been dealing with insurance and repairs - taking up a lot of time and energy. Look at this photo!\n[Image caption: a photo of a red car with a black rim parked on a sidewalk]\n[S9T1] (dia_id: D9:1)\n\nDave: Sorry to hear about the car accident, Calvin. I'm glad to hear that nobody was hurt. Dealing with insurance and repairs can definitely be time-consuming and draining. Have you encountered any issues in the insurance process so far?\n[S9T2] (dia_id: D9:2)\n\nCalvin: Hey Dave, thanks for checking in! The insurance process was a hassle - it took forever and there was a ton of paperwork. But it's all sorted now, and I'm getting it fixed up. Can't wait to drive it again!\n[Image caption: a photo of a tow truck parked in a parking lot]\n[S9T3] (dia_id: D9:3)\n\nDave: How long did it take to get everything sorted out? I'm glad it's all taken care of now!\n[S9T4] (dia_id: D9:4)\n\nCalvin: It only took a week to sort everything out. I was worried about the cost, but it wasn't too bad. Look at this photo from the auto repair shop. \n[Image caption: a photography of a man working on a car in a garage]\n[S9T5] (dia_id: D9:5)\n\nDave: Cool! Glad it wasn't too expensive. Who are him?\n[S9T6] (dia_id: D9:6)\n\nCalvin: That's the mechanic. He knows the stuff and is doing his best to get my car running again.\n[S9T7] (dia_id: D9:7)\n\nDave: That's great to hear! Skilled and knowledgeable people working on your car - are you feeling confident?\n[S9T8] (dia_id: D9:8)","text_sha256":"b6dedd5b6ffd28f051dbf66fdc60fb5e80ff6f9fcf7acd9328af74dc738290ae","timestamp":"2023-06-21T15:15:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"557de20bfece3f61e9afe8e8305a3e15c2c6f1474569dc78a6580fbb1490e746","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D6:1"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":13,"line_start":12,"source_locators":["[S6T1]"],"text_sha256":