n[S6T4] (dia_id: D6:4)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave. Appreciate the support. Waiting on insurance to kick in so I can start repairs - fingers crossed it won't take too long. Take a look at my creative haven, where I pour my heart into the music.\n[Image caption: a photo of a music studio with a keyboard, synthesizer, and other musical equipment]\n[S6T5] (dia_id: D6:5)\n\nDave: That studio looks awesome, Cal! I hope you get it fixed soon so you can continue creating music. Hang in there!\n[S6T6] (dia_id: D6:6)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! Can't wait to get back to making music. Anything exciting you're working on these days?\n[S6T7] (dia_id: D6:7)\n\nDave: I'm so excited, I opened my car shop last week! Invited some friends over to celebrate and it's been amazing. Super stoked to share my passion and help out with folks' rides. It's been incredible so far.\n[S6T8] (dia_id: D6:8)\n\nCalvin: Way to go, Dave! Congrats on opening your own car shop! Your excitement is contagious. Keep up the great work!\n[S6T9] (dia_id: D6:9)\n\nDave: Thanks, Calvin! Your support is greatly appreciated. It's been quite a journey so far, and I'm excited to see what the future holds. How about you? Anything exciting happening in the world of music for you?\n[S6T10] (dia_id: D6:10)","text_sha256":"aa7bd1d492b4ceba760ff3fb323643660a1f0b300e4ac58ed8f201fa59b8c19c","timestamp":"2023-05-16T11:50:00"}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","pre_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":695,"filesystem_tool_calls":0,"model_calls":4,"orchestration_calls":4,"prompt_tokens":12728,"provider_request_attempts":4,"provider_rounds":4,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tokens":13423},"model":{"requested_model":"coding","served_models":["qwen3.8:27b"]},"prompt_contract":{"derived_prompt_sha256":"6930d93099ac20b76e881b68cbb63b46e1a0a3e2ff43453db6855